						<r3d:remarks>ICPSR is covered by Thomson Reuters Data Citation Index. is covered by Elsevier. ICPSR is an international, membership-based consortium of more than 700 academic institutions and research organizations; ICPSR provides leadership and training in data access, curation, and methods of analysis for the social science research community.In fiscal year 2012, ICPSR secured $10 million in grants and contracts through federal agencies, foundations, and the private sector. ICPSR is also a subcontractor on grants through outside universities and organizations.</r3d:remarks>
